sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant O as Order service
    participant L as Event log
    participant P as Product service

    C->>O: POST /orders
    O->>L: append OrderPlaced (v1)
    O-xP: POST /reservations
    Note over P: down
    O-->>C: 202 Accepted, status placed

    Note over O,L: every few seconds the reconciler<br/>looks for orders that are still placed
    Note over P: comes back
    O->>P: POST /reservations  (same order id)
    P-->>O: 201 reserved (exactly once)
    O->>L: append OrderConfirmed (v2)
    C->>O: GET /orders/{id}
    O-->>C: 200, status confirmed
